  "gcd_statement_signatures_and_axioms": "BezoutCounterexample.main_theorem_gcd :\n  ∃ S x x_1,\n    IsDomain S ∧\n      IsBezout S ∧\n        (∀ (a b : S), ∃ x_2 y, x_2 * a + y * b = gcd a b) ∧\n          ∃ a b c, gcd a (gcd b c) = 1 ∧ ∀ (p q : S), gcd (p * a) (p * b + q * c) ≠ 1\nBezoutCounterexample.exists_gcd_counterexample :\n  ∃ a b c, gcd a (gcd b c) = 1 ∧ ∀ (p q : BezoutCounterexample.R), gcd (p * a) (p * b + q * c) ≠ 1\nBezoutCounterexample.gcd_eq_sum (a b : BezoutCounterexample.R) : ∃ x y, x * a + y * b = gcd a b\n'BezoutCounterexample.main_theorem_gcd' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n'BezoutCounterexample.exists_gcd_counterexample' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n"
